,"elements":[{"id":"6435f31","elType":"widget","settings":{"shortcode":"<a class='weatherwidget-io' href='https://forecast7.com/en/31d63n7d98/marrakesh/' data-label_1='MARRAKECH' data-label_2='WEATHER' data-icons='Climacons Animated' data-days='3' data-theme='weather_one' >MARRAKECH WEATHER</a> <script> !function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src='https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,'script','weatherwidget-io-js'); </script>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"shortcode"},{"id":"0a45d48","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":31,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"d1b1976","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Bike in Morocco","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Protest Strike","title_color":"#E77717","_animation":"fadeInLeft","header_size":"h1"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"dbc474c","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Gaze at the starry sky above the Moroccan desert after a camel ride, and climb closer to heaven in the highest mountains of North Africa. At the same time, explore remote landscapes through unforgettable gravel bike tours in Morocco. Ride scenic off-road trails across the Atlas Mountains, while sipping fresh mint tea with locals in ancient Berber villages. As a result, every ride becomes an authentic gravel biking adventure guided by experienced local professionals.</p>","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Germania One","text_shadow_text_shadow_type":"yes","text_shadow_text_shadow":{"horizontal":0,"vertical":0,"blur":10,"color":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},"text_color":"#000000","_animation":"fadeIn","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"18","right":"18","bottom":"18","left":"18","isLinked":true},"paragraph_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"5873414","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Gravel Biking Adventures Across Morocco","align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"0cb0d4f","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>We Gravel Morocco is a local team of certified cycling and mountain guides based in Marrakech and Azilal. We design guided gravel bike, mountain bike and e-bike tours on quiet dirt roads and ancient caravan routes – from the High Atlas and the Happy Valley to the Draa oasis and the Sahara Desert – with full vehicle support, comfortable accommodation and delicious local food.</p>","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Germania One","text_shadow_text_shadow_type":"yes","text_shadow_text_shadow":{"horizontal":0,"vertical":0,"blur":10,"color":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},"text_color":"#000000","_animation":"fadeIn","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"18","right":"18","bottom":"18","left":"18","isLinked":true},"paragraph_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"5aab01c","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Why Morocco Is Perfect for Gravel Bike Holidays","align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"280f891","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Morocco offers rich and exciting cycling tours for riders of all levels. In addition, these routes connect famous cities such as Marrakesh, Fes, Meknes, and Rabat. From there, cyclists move from desert roads to mountain paths, so every day brings a new experience. For this reason, Morocco is ideal for adventure cycling and off-road travel.</p>","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Germania One","text_shadow_text_shadow_type":"yes","text_shadow_text_shadow":{"horizontal":0,"vertical":0,"blur":10,"color":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},"text_color":"#000000","_animation":"fadeIn","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"18","right":"18","bottom":"18","left":"18","isLinked":true},"paragraph_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":3,"sizes"